  dir_message_err_fatal.pcpp - break step of dir_message.pcpp:
  @message fatal, as a statement: reported as fatal, the build fails

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\dir_message_err_fatal.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\dir_message_err_fatal.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
